# AriaBC / BCDB Architecture — Comprehensive Reference

> **Scope**: This document reflects the checked-out codebase under
> `src/backend/bcdb/` and all PostgreSQL hook points it depends on.  It
> describes **what the code does today**, including the motivation behind
> every design decision, known pitfalls, partially-wired infrastructure,
> and performance history.  Reading this document cover-to-cover should
> give you a complete mental model of the system without needing to read
> a single source file.

